WEBVTT

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.480
Listen up, maggots!

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.660
The day of Persia's birth has finally come!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.830
Yes, sir!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.180
The party is after classes finish.
Failure of plans is inexcusable!

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.490
Sir! Yes, sir!

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.120
First, Persia will descend on a gondola
surrounded by smoke!

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.120
Next, the Persia marching band enters!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.370
Then, we will gift the Persia statue!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.310
But what if those Black Doggies
try to interfere again?

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:32.130
Yeah, every year those guys
turn this day into a Persia pie-throwing party.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.560
-Damn!
-Calm yourselves!

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.860
Those Black Doggy barbarians are no match!

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.280
If Inuzuka shows up,
we'll toss him right back out!

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.890
Besides, this year we--

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.560
-Inuzuka!
-What the hell!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.580
Hey! Get down here!

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.620
You savage!

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.070
Hey!

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.450
Persia.

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.840
Inuzuka? What's he doing there?

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.760
Sorry, Char.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.410
I forgot something.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.340
-Wait!
-Hey!

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.220
Where are you going?

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.080
I've waited so long for Persia's birthday.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.210
I couldn't celebrate with her.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.090
All I did was make her worry.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.850
But her birthday isn't over just yet!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:59.790
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:08.640
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:14.640
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:19.980
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:25.150
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:28.910
So that I can protect you

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:34.410
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:39.960
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:45.010
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:51.970
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:59.070
Romio and Juliet and the Birthday

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.910
What? She's avoiding me.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.840
Hey, wait up!

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.010
I can't.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.790
I'm not going to kill you, just stop.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.300
Damn it!

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.050
Hear me out!

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.240
Now I've got you.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.370
You can't run anymore.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:34.910
Are you stupid?

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.120
What if your brother saw us?

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.960
My brother is in class.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.830
Now is our chance.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.300
We might be seen by someone else.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.880
I'm aware of the risk.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.300
If you're caught you might be expelled from school!

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.710
That's not something new, you know?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.680
Are you fine with this?

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.270
We won't be able to see each other.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.190
Of course I'm not.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.820
But...

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.270
Persia...

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.020
I'm sorry.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.900
I don't want to see you right now.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.220
Whoa, seriously?

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.550
Yeah, seriously.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:34.420
So, then I said--

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.890
There's something on the--

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:38.800
He's dead!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.650
Wait, Inuzuka? What happened?

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.300
He needs to see the nurse!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:47.820
I see. I think I understand the situation.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.430
Jeez, look at the shape you're in.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.460
You're a bona fide idiot.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.310
This is why I tried to stop you.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:59.830
It's no use. He's not listening.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.670
Leave me be.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:05.200
I'll live out the rest of my days here in this infirmary.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.200
Your focus will shift once you're in class.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.130
I don't want to go to school.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.130
I don't want to do anything.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.960
You're already at school...

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.970
I couldn't even discuss it with her.

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:20.670
I can't tell what Persia's thinking.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.430
In that case...

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.190
Want to skip class?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:44.710
No one's in the game room.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:45.900
It's all ours!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.880
It's not so bad to skip once in a while.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.590
Are you sure about this?

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.760
Should a smart girl like you be skipping?

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:54.300
It's fine.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.800
Hasuki isn't...

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.420
quite as straight-laced as you think.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.630
Oh, professor.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.390
Professor! We're definitely not cutting class.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.520
We're simply studying life.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.230
Made you look.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:09.240
Don't tease me!

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.320
Darn it, Inuzuka.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.860
But as his friend,

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:17.370
I don't want to see him sad.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.490
I have to be cheer him up.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.760
He's so high-maintenance.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.440
Let's play some billiards!

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.000
Sorry, I'm just not feeling it.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.520
That's exactly why we're playing.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.720
Here!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.200
But I've never played.

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.210
You set up like this...

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.460
then shoot! Like that.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.050
Line it up...

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.650
Yeah. Then aim at the ball.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:53.740
Shoot!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.070
That's not the ball!

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.200
Sorry!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.560
They just popped out at me!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.040
How embarrassing.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.830
We're done with billiards!

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.070
Next game!

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.640
Now we can hug the stable sheep all we want.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.580
They're running away.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.580
Oh, try using some feed.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.680
Help!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.840
Hasuki!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.940
This is too dangerous! Next!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.720
Okay.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.610
Look at that view, Inuzuka!

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:39.600
Doesn't seeing scenery like this
just blow your worries away?

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.930
Yeah, I guess.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.750
Hey, what's that?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.440
Whoa, don't lean so far.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.170
That was close!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.030
Th-Thanks...

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.430
Why is my heart racing?

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:03.780
I was supposed to be the one cheering him up today.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:06.000
But Inuzuka's hand...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.850
It's so strong.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.730
Get a hold of yourself!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.260
Hasuki!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.140
You're bleeding!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.760
Oh, this is nothing.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:25.460
It says here,
"The wall is brittle, please stay back."

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.250
Let's go.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.400
Okay.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.710
Let's come back some time.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.870
Let's have another date soon!

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:39.620
Yeah...

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:45.880
Classes are over! Take your positions!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.270
Yes, sir!

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.950
Per.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.220
Per?

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.590
Per?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.220
Per.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.520
Per!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.480
Char!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.950
Goodness.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:08.830
Your birthday party is starting.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:12.200
It won't be a party without the guest of honor.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:14.110
S-sorry.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:20.120
Aren't these the cookies
you were going to give to Inuzuka last night?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:24.360
The ones you made as thanks for your birthday present.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.520
Why are they still here?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:29.020
You're wrong.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.630
These cookies...

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.900
were actually for you.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.420
Dig in.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.570
I knew it, something did happen.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:42.360
What are you talking about?

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.520
Come on.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.520
You look so distressed.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.780
I hurt Inuzuka.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.500
It's because I wanted to be together.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.920
I thought I was prepared for this treacherous path.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.340
But...

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:06.470
when I realized I'd just keep hurting him,
I got scared.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.680
I lost sight of what I should be doing.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:11.760
I can't even face Inuzuka.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.810
I don't want us to be apart...

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:15.730
I want to be with him forever.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:18.940
It's okay, dear.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.900
It's okay.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.910
That was one heck of a day!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.110
It was fun!

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.910
Thanks, Hasuki!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.400
Thanks to you, I'm full of energy!

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.130
That's a lie.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:36.290
What is?

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.530
I'm really--

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:41.590
Dummy! How many years
do you think we've been friends?

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.410
I can see right through you.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.170
It's frustrating.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:53.660
I guess I'm...

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.730
not enough.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:01.400
That's not it! It's not that you're not enough!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.820
I'm...

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.490
Sorry, Inuzuka.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.430
I didn't mean to put this on you.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.720
Damn it. What am I doing?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.940
I even made Hasuki worry.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.870
Inuzuka! Stop that!

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.550
Your cuts will open again!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.840
I was just putting a little life into my weak self.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.330
Now my eyes are open.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.830
You're such an idiot.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.520
Good grief!

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.840
How irksome.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.300
Char!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.230
Hey you...

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.610
If you like Inuzuka,
you should just let him have it!

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.790
Why do you even have these lumps of fat?

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.660
If you had just claimed him early on,

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.220
Per would be free.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:00.970
That way Per wouldn't have to be
so wrought with worry.

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:02.210
What did you just say?

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:03.910
-Here, take this.
-Huh?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.970
They're the cookies
she was going to bring you last night.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.730
There, I've handed them over.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.540
I must be losing my mind.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.890
Hey, what are you--?

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:17.640
Sorry, I'm not taking questions at this time!

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.350
I'm so busy, after all.

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:22.270
Per's birthday bash is about to start.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:25.190
Per's birthday bash!

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.780
Shut up! Don't say it twice!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:27.930
Bye-meow!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:32.190
Get back here! Apologize for slapping my breasts!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.810
These cookies... No way...

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.500
Inuzuka?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.200
What's wrong?

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.630
They're so good...

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.300
These cookies...

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.520
They're sublime.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:56.710
Oh, I see...

00:12:57.680 --> 00:12:59.840
Her cookies were so bad before.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:03.980
Had she been practicing since then? For me?

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:09.360
Persia was always putting in so much effort
to please me.

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.730
And all I can do is pout...

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.330
I don't know why...

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.960
but you seem fine now.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.490
Yeah.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:26.660
I don't want to see you put in harm's way,

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:30.740
but I also hate seeing you
so down in the dumps.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:35.000
So, I'd rather see you looking up
with that stupid grin on your face.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.650
Right!

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.500
Thanks, Hasuki.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.190
Oh, by the way.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:44.200
-Want to take part in our yearly tradition?
-Sure!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.690
But classes are already over.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.510
Will we make it?
Your brother will be watching again.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.260
No problem.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.020
This is something I want him to see.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.880
Well, well.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:06.280
It's not often you come to me looking for advice.

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.380
Little Persia.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:12.440
But should you be doing this?

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:14.490
Your birthday party is today.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.420
Yes. Once we're done, I'll head over--

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.600
Rep, there's trouble!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.550
There's a group of pie-wielding Black Doggies!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:25.190
Let Persia's pie-throwing party begin!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.050
I'm going to hit her first!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.050
One hundred a piece!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.970
Yoo-hoo, Persia!

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.990
We're here to celebrate your birthday.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:39.190
At the head of the pack is Romio Inuzuka!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:40.980
Miss Persia!

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.370
You're their target.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.610
You should sit tight.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.000
Now...

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.120
I've dragged everyone else into this.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:58.060
Once I find Persia, I'll drag her away,
by force if necessary.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.770
This time I'll wish her happy birthday.
Then she'll have to...

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:06.010
You did all of this for me?
I'm so happy! I'm moved!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.680
-Don't say we can't see each other.
-Okay.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.260
It's the perfect strategy!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.610
Persia, where are you? Get out here!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.860
You've made a fatal error, Inuzuka.

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.890
Lady Persia is not here!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.830
If you back down now,

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:24.970
we'll let you off with just a few pies to the face.

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:29.130
Or perhaps you'd like to do a thorough search?
I'd be happy--

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.280
Coming through!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.420
-Go! Find Persia!
-Yes!

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:36.790
-Our time is up whenever Airu decides to show up!
-Let's go!

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.650
Return fire!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:46.670
-I wish Maru had come along.
-He said he wasn't interested.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.220
If it gets rough, pull back!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.550
You too, Inuzuka!

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:53.730
That guy...

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.400
It's not like I've acknowledged their relationship.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:59.240
I just don't want to see him out of sorts.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:00.690
Payback!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.790
Damn you, four-eyes!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.570
Come at me, miss prissy!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:09.460
Lame. You can't even come up with a good insult.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.080
It was not lame!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.420
It wasn't, right guys?

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:13.750
Quite lame.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.080
That's right! If I ask Char, maybe I can find Persia.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.580
There she is!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:23.710
How dare you ruin Per's birthday bash.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.080
I'll kill you later.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.880
Yeah, that's a no.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:31.100
That simpleton. He's too awkward.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.880
Play your little heart out.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:38.640
The White Cats House isn't so weak
that it could be besieged so easily.

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.400
-Hi!
-What?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.570
It's been since the sports festival!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.530
Somali? Does that mean he's here too?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.530
We've caught you, Inuzuka.

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:03.160
-Pardon me, who are you?
-It's Aby.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:07.060
Aby? Wait, you look completely different!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.670
My sports festival trickery was exposed,

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.550
the Aby faction was dissolved,
and I was thrown out of the dorm.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:17.430
Now I live in the yard,
pursuing an extended, self-sufficient lifestyle.

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:20.420
You've really toughened up, I see.

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.680
I'm repenting for my actions.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:27.770
With the underhanded methods I used,
there's no way I'd still be supported.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:32.420
This time, I will have support in excess!
I shall make my return!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:34.650
Inuzuka, you will be a sacrifice to that end!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.290
The hell you are!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:41.160
Damn, it's that idiot strength of hers.
If it's come to this...

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.800
Hey, Aby, why are you glaring at me like that?

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:49.520
Somali, this guy is getting super jealous
with you clinging to me like this.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:52.230
-Oh, no!
-Don't listen to him!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.690
Look at that rage-filled face!

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.180
Should you leave him like that?

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.360
I'm sorry, Aby!

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.420
You fool!

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.820
Her idiocy saved me.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.530
I won't ever let go again.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:04.780
I can't breathe.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:05.940
Later.

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.440
You're too late.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.440
There he is!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.960
-Get him!
-Over here.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.200
Yeah!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:25.340
Where'd he go?

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.500
-Did he run away?
-Find him!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.850
Split up.

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.270
Got it!

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:36.010
That was a close one.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.090
Who are you?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.010
Why did you help me?

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.910
This guy smells like serious trouble.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.770
Don't be so on guard.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:50.270
I'm Cait Sith, a second-year.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.650
It's a pleasure, Inuzuka.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.650
How are you "dong" today?

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:06.630
Come on, take a joke!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:10.160
-You're looking at me like I flopped.
-You flopped, all right!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.730
-Who is this guy? This guy's got issues.
-"How are you 'dong' today" wasn't obvious enough?

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:17.740
-It was so embarrassing to show a stranger.
-I'd better run.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.150
See you!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:21.690
Wait, wait!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.050
Don't follow me!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.400
Don't be like that.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.720
I've acquired an interest in you.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:31.690
You did think up this game
to get both dorms in high spirits.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:34.750
So, I really wanted to meet you.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.130
Before a certain someone caught you.

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.200
Did that kill your buzz?

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.000
Sorry!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.950
I'll tell you where Persia is, though.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:45.950
Why do you...?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:49.400
I really like things that are fun, you see.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.350
Games are boring unless people get fired up.

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:54.650
Persia is above us.

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.230
In the corner room on the fourth floor.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.020
Now, that's all I'm going to tell you.

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.570
Fight, Romio!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.850
Representative.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:07.350
The moment I lose sight of you...

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:10.400
Whoopsie, we've been found already.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.350
You're not very lucky.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.480
What game are you playing now?
Do you want to die?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:22.250
Sieber! You came looking for me?

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.120
-I wish I wouldn't find you until the end of time.
-How rude!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:26.860
Representative?

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.130
What's this about?

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:29.880
Oh, sorry, sorry.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:34.130
I didn't intend to deceive you.
Let me introduce myself again.

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:38.420
I'm a White Cats House second-year,
and the representative prefect , Cait Sith.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.650
Cait Sith
White Cats House Representative Prefect

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.980
And she's the West's banter machine, Sieber!

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.120
Who are you calling...

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.940
banter machine?

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.520
Sieber, not the eyes!

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.020
Romio Inuzuka.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:56.160
Rex has suppressed your lackeys on the first floor.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.330
You should surrender as well.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:03.250
So, you were trying to trap me from the start?

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.590
No, it was just your bad luck that got us caught.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:10.870
Well, now that it's come to this,
I must fulfill my position as representative.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.760
I was called in as support today.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:16.630
I wanted to watch you for a bit longer, but...

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.270
This is...

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.630
game over.

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:31.270
I didn't expect the rep to shut me in here.

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:34.640
I shouldn't have gone to him for advice.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:37.790
I came to stop you.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.010
But...

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.690
it seems I was too late.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.900
This time, I'll make it in time!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:33.760
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:41.770
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:49.070
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:55.700
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:03.920
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:10.260
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:17.510
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:19.720
I want to support you

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:27.560
With everything I have

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:35.660
Until the world can one day change

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.780
I vowed to change the world.

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:42.020
I was moved by his words.

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:44.900
That's why I can't just give up here.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:47.500
Even if it's forbidden love, we're serious.

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:49.530
-That's why I...
-I...

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:49.570
Next time, "Romio and Juliet."

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:51.670
Romio and Juliet
Next time, "Romio and Juliet."

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:52.070
Romio and Juliet
